  <p id="c-liangshu-021-liujingyan-yan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">少子<persName id="c-liangshu-021-liujingyan-yan:p001:m0002" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAA">偃</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-021-liujingyan-yan:p001:m0005" ref="5jc_z9b_i2n_AAAAAA">彥遊</persName>。年十二引見。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-021-liujingyan-yan:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">詔尚<persName id="c-liangshu-021-liujingyan-yan:p002:m0002" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_I">長城公主</persName>，拜駙馬都尉，都亭侯，太子舍人，洗馬，廬陵、鄱陽內史。大寶元年，卒。</p>
